    <sectiondef kind="user-defined">
      <header>Debug macros.</header>
      <description><para>Defines a common prefix for all debug messages.</para>
<para>Uses the DEBUG_TAG macro which must be defined in each .cpp file to identify the message source.</para>
<para><programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">[level][millis()][<ref refid="DS3231M_8cpp_1ae6f84e8321c3bc4f546cf4a2a4798064" kindref="member">DEBUG_TAG</ref>]<sp/></highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> */ #define DEBUG_PRINT_PREFIX(level) \ Serial.print(F(&quot;[&quot;)); \ Serial.print(level); \ Serial.print(F(&quot;][&quot;)); \ Serial.print(millis()); \ Serial.print(F(&quot;][&quot;)); \ Serial.print(DEBUG_TAG); \ Serial.print(F(&quot;] &quot;))</para>
<para>/**</para>
<para>Used like the <computeroutput>printf()</computeroutput> function. Automatically adds the DEBUG level, current millis as a <emphasis>timestamp</emphasis>, and the module that generated it.</para>
<para>Example:</para>
<para><programlisting filename=".cpp"><codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="Debug_8h_1a1c488ea7efca861a91f3c31f88ac647c" kindref="member">DEBUG_ERROR</ref>(</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;Unable<sp/>to<sp/>establish<sp/>communication<sp/>with<sp/>RTC&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">);</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
<para><programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">[ERROR][1543][RTC]<sp/>Unable<sp/>to<sp/>establish<sp/>communication<sp/>with<sp/>RTC<sp/></highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
</description>
      <memberdef kind="define" id="Debug_8h_1a1c488ea7efca861a91f3c31f88ac647c" prot="public" static="no">
        <name>DEBUG_ERROR</name>
        <param><defname>format</defname></param>
        <param><defname>...</defname></param>
        <initializer>  if (<ref refid="Debug_8h_1ac2d33ccaf63f5d5b66552b95426c0137" kindref="member">DEBUG_LEVEL</ref> &gt;= 1) { \
